        {
          "externalId": "no8bzh1",
          "body": "There's a newer version of this model with full size ports.\nG8sd I think it's called, it has a black remote. \nI bought it 3 days ago. When I first set it up it asked me for an update. \nMy initial impression is that the panel it's great, if it had android instead of tizen os it would have been awesome",
          "parentExternalId": "OP",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "externalId": "noajj1p",
          "body": "important to keep in mind is the newer version(SD) has a matte panel coating. thats the exact reason i myself bought the older version (SB). depends on his preference",
          "parentExternalId": "no8bzh1",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "externalId": "no7thya",
          "body": "I’ve had mine for almost a year. The display is great! Software is awful. Takes for ever to get to the settings you want. Sometimes it just doesn’t register correctly as a display and just blanks out. Common issues.",
          "parentExternalId": "OP",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "externalId": "no7sec1",
          "authorId": "t2_clamatodiver",
          "authorName": "ClamatoDiver",
          "body": "I've had mine since July of 2023, and I love it. It was $999 USD back then so $999 AUD sounds like a fantastic deal.",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "externalId": "no9g6yh",
          "authorId": "t2_prestigious_swing303",
          "authorName": "Prestigious_Swing303",
          "body": "Hey, have you faced issues like burn-ins or anything else so far and how is the text clarity?\n\nI'm planning to get it (G85SD model) for 80% coding, 20% gaming",
          "parentExternalId": "no7sec1",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "externalId": "noabtjk",
          "authorId": "t2_clamatodiver",
          "authorName": "ClamatoDiver",
          "body": "No burn in, but I have taken preventative measures from day one. \n\nAuto hide the tool bar, auto hide the Icons, use Wallpaper Engine, run the monitor health on occasion. \n\nI wear glasses now because my eyes aren't the better than normal that they used to be, and sometimes I upscale the UI in games a little and the same in browsers, but that's a me thing for when I want to take the glasses off sometimes, not the monitor itself.",
          "parentExternalId": "no9g6yh",
          "nodeType": "PLAN",
          "depth": 3
        },
        {
          "externalId": "OP",
          "authorId": "t2_significant_drop_870",
