          "authorName": "NotQuiteAngryHunt",
          "body": "Could you link the video please. I have had this for a year now. Very happy with it. Only issues I’ve had are with monitor arm compatibility. Found a seller on eBay who prints a clean vesa mount adapter in UK.",
