        {
          "externalId": "noe3ird",
          "body": "The UI and OS, apparently, are infuriating.  You have to connect to your PC every single time you turn on the monitor.  It’s more a tv/monitor hybrid.   It is not a plug and play monitor.   \n\nI have a couple homies who have this monitor and they HATE how long it takes to start up and then manually select the PC output every single time they use it.  I went Alienware 34” OLED because of it",
